# Cursor Rules

## Main Purpose

- **Primary Goal**: This website is a landing page for an iOS app that extracts audio from video. All content, design, and functionality should be optimized to promote and drive downloads of the iOS app.

## File Modification Rules

- **DO NOT** modify `index.html` - it is a generated file. All HTML changes should be made in `build/template.html` instead.
- **DO NOT** modify `README.md` by hand — it is generated by `npm run build` (see `build/build.js`). Update URLs in `build/constants.js` instead.
- When making changes to the template, update `build/template.html` and regenerate the HTML files using the build script.

## Project Structure

- `build/template.html` - Main template file for generating HTML
- `build/build.js` - Build script that generates HTML, `urls.txt`, and `README.md` from template and constants
- `build/*.json` - Translation files for multiple languages (en, ru, de, es, fr, it, pt)
- `index.html` - Generated file for English (do not edit directly)
- `README.md` - Generated list of site URLs (do not edit directly)
- `*/index.html` - Generated files for language-specific pages (de, es, fr, it, pt, ru) - do not edit directly
- `style.css` - Main stylesheet
- `privacy.html` - Privacy policy page
- `terms.html` - Terms of service page
- `package.json` - Node.js dependencies and scripts

## Landing v2 (English) and guides

- English, Russian, German, Spanish, French, Italian, Portuguese (pt-BR), Japanese, Korean, Dutch, Polish, Romanian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Czech, Simplified Chinese, Danish, Greek, Finnish, Filipino, Hebrew (RTL), Croatian, Hungarian, Indonesian, Malay, Norwegian, Slovak, Swedish, Bulgarian, Slovenian, Catalan, Hindi, Bengali, Tamil, Telugu and Malayalam homepages are rendered from `build/landing-template.html` + `build/<lang>.json` (UI strings in `ui` / `guide_ui`) (see `LANDING_V2_LANGUAGES` in `build/constants.js`). Other locales still use `build/template.html`.
- Keyword guides live in `build/guides/<lang>.js` (en, ru, de, es, fr, it, pt, ja, ko, nl, pl, ro, th, tr, uk, vi, cs, zh, da, el, fi, fil, he, hr, hu, id, ms, no, sk, sv, bg, sl, ca, hi, bn, ta, te, ml — see `GUIDES_LANGUAGES`) and render to `/guides/…` and `/<lang>/guides/…` via `build/guides.js` and `build/guide-template.html` (run automatically by `npm run build`). Do not edit files in `/guides/` by hand.
- Styles for landing v2 and guides: `landing.css` (has `:lang(ja)`, `:lang(ko)`, `:lang(th)` blocks — CJK/Hangul/Thai headings use a native sans instead of Fraunces). Classic locales: `style.css`.
- Keyword research: `keywords.md`. App Store listing data: `app.md`.
